\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.8}{\ignorespaces Observed phial failure modes: \textit {Dome} (A), \textit {Bulge} (B), \textit {Neck} (C), \textit {Base} (D) and \textit {Body Wall} (E), together with examples of hybrid modes (A+D and D+E).}}{31}{figure.caption.23}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.9}{\ignorespaces Failure modes observed over the 76 tested phials. Left: share of each single and hybrid mode. Right: number of phials, stiffness range and failure load range for each mode, with its split between the two batches (\textit {Batch mix}) and the fraction of each batch that failed in that mode (\textit {\% of batch with this mode}).}}{32}{figure.caption.24}%
