\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.12}{\ignorespaces Failure load distributions of Batch A and Batch B. Top: fitted two-parameter Weibull probability density functions, with the 1st and 5th percentiles marked. Bottom: individual failure loads, grouped by batch and displacement rate.}}{34}{figure.caption.27}%
